    "result": {"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Industry Context:</strong> Developed for high-speed Packaging, FMCG, and modern Manufacturing lines to automate product sorting and placement.</li>\n<li><strong>Core Operation:</strong> Programmed logic for multi-axis robotic movements using both Delta DVP/SX2 and Siemens S7-1200 PLCs.</li>\n<li><strong>Precision Control:</strong> Developed highly accurate position control logic to ensure products are picked and placed exactly on the designated conveyor or packaging box.</li>\n<li><strong>Actuation:</strong> Configured complex pneumatic systems, solenoid valves, and actuator sequences for smooth and rapid arm operation.</li>\n<li><strong>Associated With:</strong> Ulterior Engineering Ltd.</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Pick and Place Robotic Arm Control","date":"2026-07-05","tech":["Delta DVP/SX2","Siemens S7-1200","Position Control","Pneumatic Sequence"],"github":"","external":"","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/de105/robotic-arm.jpg","srcSet":"/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/7ac0a/robotic-arm.jpg 250w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/51a07/robotic-arm.jpg 500w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/de105/robotic-arm.jpg 1000w","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/827c7/robotic-arm.avif 250w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/60cfc/robotic-arm.avif 500w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/0b70d/robotic-arm.avif 1000w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/6ef21/robotic-arm.webp 250w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/12849/robotic-arm.webp 500w,\n/static/fb3028b6c8a69c4f4ee479f0bfa861db/85e35/robotic-arm.webp 1000w","type":"image/webp","sizes":